  "description": "Lee Shin-Hui has always juggled odd jobs to support his ailing brother, but when he accidentally shatters a mysterious marble, he's dragged into a demonic realm! Just as all hope seems lost, he's rescued by a powerful dokkaebi named Ohwi, who demands Shin-Hui's soul qi to satisfy his own hunger. Trapped in a dangerous world and bound to Ohwi's desires, can Shin-Hui find a way back home, or is he doomed to become Ohwi's personal soul qi vessel forever?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
